# Reactivity Model

Coming soon — this page explains the philosophical core of Reactor's
reactivity: state-setter → re-render, why hooks instead of
`INotifyPropertyChanged`, where `ShouldUpdate` and `Memo` fit, and how
this differs from classic MVVM observable property change. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Hooks](hooks.md) covers the surface model.
